<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-ENGLAND AND NZ TIE THIRD ONE-DAYER.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND AND NZ TIE THIRD ONE-DAYER.</headline>
<dateline>NAPIER, New Zealand 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>England and New Zealand tied the third one-day cricket match of the five-match series on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>New Zealand 237 all out from 49.4 overs (B.Young 53, C.White 4-37)</p>
<p>England 237-8 from 50 overs (G.Thorpe 55).</p>
